.claude/README.md:86:- **Judgment, synthesis, writing → Opus.** `best_practice_synthesis` has an
.claude/settings.json:77:            "command": "printf '%s\\n' '================ GUIDEBOOK RESEARCH CONTRACT (harness-injected) ================' 'RESEARCH IS INVALID IF NOT COMPLIANT WITH OUR GOVERNANCE, VERIFICATION TOOLS,' 'RULES AND ETHOS. Compliance is mechanical, not remembered.' '' 'BEFORE admitting evidence:' '  R1  Co-1 / T2 / Co-2 pass FIRST - no exceptions (Co-1 co-primary w/ T1, CRPD' '      4.3)' '  R5  Non-English peer-reviewed work is ACADEMIC, not grey. Non-indexation in' '      PubMed/Scopus is an INDEXING fact, not an evidence-quality fact.' '  R9  Pre-check the DOI. If it exists, cross-file the existing ref_id - never' '      duplicate.' '  R10 Re-retrieve every locator. DOI -> Crossref/PubMed -> publisher ->' '      repository. A publisher block is NOT a terminal answer. No re-retrieval' '      = no admission. NEVER leave verification_status NULL on a source' '      carrying a URL: that is the exact pool the scheduled url-verification' '      cron claims, and it pushes a DB blob to main. UNVERIFIED is a real value' '      - say it.' '  R17 Every admission has a logged search behind it. A source taken from a' '      list is logged as one (db.py log-search --origin lead-index ...' '      --admitted-ref-id R), so search coverage sees it; a held source with no' '      edge gets one (db.py link-admission).' '' 'WHILE searching:' '  R2  Mine every CONFIRMED T1-T2 anchor backward AND forward. Depth 2-3 via' '      citation-miner; gap-driven mode is depth-1 per pass and hands off.' '  R4  Cross slug x EVERY lens: identity / access-need / ICF / medical' '      (D-0170). NOT (item x population) - the item layer was deleted' '      2026-09-01, and base_taxonomy_identity is ONLY the identity lens, so' '      framing on it alone is the traversal D-0184 rejected. THE KEY IS RULED:' '      a cell is parameter_id (base_parameters) x at least one of the four lens' '      columns - subject ruled 2026-08-26, lens ruled 2026-08-28 as relaxed by' '      D-0182.' '  R7  Capture FAILURE / HARM / INADEQUACY as first-class evidence, not a' '      by-product.' '  R8  Log EVERY query verbatim before screening, WITH --prior-expectation' '      written BEFORE you run it - a prior recorded after seeing results is a' '      rationalisation, not a prior (DR-2026-05-09). KEEP EMPTIES - a' '      zero-yield search is a COMPLETED unit of work. Never delete or backfill' '      them.' '  R13 Grade population-of-STUDY vs population-SERVED on every admission. No' '      match row = silently claiming they are the same.' '      Children/general-population/no-participants = PROXY.' '  R14 A zero-yield search is evidence of ABSENCE only if the query was' '      well-formed. PubMed AND-chains every term: say query-shape failure vs' '      wrong index vs genuine absence.' '' 'WHEN filing:' '  R3  Quantified values need a locator or [UNVERIFIED-QUANT]. Code/standard' '      values: clause/section/page. Outcome claims: DOI + page/table, or a' '      direct URL.' '  R6  Findings go in findings_note. deferred_reason means DELIBERATELY NOT' '      SEARCHED.' '  R7  Off-slug or unverified material -> search_candidates' '      (REHOME/MISC/PENDING), not prose.' '  R11 No back-translation. Every alias carries its in-language source, else' '      [UNVERIFIED-TERMS]. HARVEST AS YOU GO: db.py observe-term for each' '      concept phrase a source USES, in the source'\\''s own words. That is a fact' '      about the document, not a claim it names one of our categories; judgment' '      adjudicates it later (D-0173).' '  R12 Case studies -> case_studies. Economics -> economics_entries. Code' '      values -> research_code_leads. Never leave them in prose notes.' '  R15 A staged candidate description is a HYPOTHESIS. On resolution,' '      re-describe it from the source and CORRECT it if you over-claimed. Do' '      not let your own guess harden into fact.' '  R16 A figure a source states is extracted against a parameter, never left' '      only in prose or a code lead (a lead records where to look; R12 keeps' '      it): observe-term -> adjudicate-term (or add-term) -> add-parameter ->' '      add-extraction. Every phrase observed on this batch'\\''s admissions is' '      adjudicated (NOT-OURS and DEFERRED are answers), and every term those' '      adjudications name is a parameter or is declined with its reason (db.py' '      decline-parameter). Read EVERY admission against the WHOLE parameter' '      list, whatever slug it came in under, and record the reading (db.py' '      record-scan --mode catalogue): slugs guide searches, not what is mined' '      from a source.' '' 'ALWAYS: migrations-only (emit_data_migration -> migrate_db). Never hand-edit the DB.' 'Never author best_practice_synthesis below the Opus floor. Never move an adjudicated figure.' 'Gate before you claim done:  python3 scripts/audit/research_batch_dod.py --session <id>' '==============================================================================='"
