attestations/decisions_DR-2026-07-21-tier-doctrine-source-class-consistency.json:25:   "reason": "Tier assignment routes what strength band a source anchors at (mission doctrine #2 / weighted-strength model). Correcting mis-tiered foundational sources (ASPECTSS, DIN 18040, the RIBA guide, the Black scoping review) directly affects which best-practice claims they can anchor, so the routing rule is in scope."
