attestations/sessions_session_2026-07-25-energy-conservation-rest-points-seating-b2.json:39:   "reason": "No best_practice_synthesis authored. The slug now has a substantially stronger evidence base and the temptation to synthesise was correspondingly higher, but the Co-1 base is still ONE source and two Co-1 candidates are access-blocked (GAP-309). Synthesising a slug about disabled people's rest needs on a single lived-experience source would invert the doctrine's own tier logic. opus_synthesis remains false."
